{"id":"413686","name":"猪肝粉炖鸡蛋","author":"铃兰蝴蝶","authorId":"6622556","desc":"","cover":"images/413686/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肝粉","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"少量"},{"name":"醋","amount":"少量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"少量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"少量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/413686/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入1.5倍的水。","img":"images/413686/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入少量盐后，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/413686/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用过筛器过滤。","img":"images/413686/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"过滤后的鸡蛋特别细腻。","img":"images/413686/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入猪肝粉。","img":"images/413686/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀后盖上保鲜膜。","img":"images/413686/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"热水烧开，放入鸡蛋，蒸10-15分钟即可。","img":"images/413686/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"去掉保鲜膜。","img":"images/413686/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入生抽，陈醋，香油即可，这个味道特别香的，醋能遮住鸡蛋的腥味，也能遮住猪肝粉的味道！","img":"images/413686/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}